 Dear players, hello everyone. I am Pi Zai, the producer of "Real Estate tycoon". I regret to inform you that "Real Estate tycoon" cannot continue to be updated after I have tried multiple times. I apologize for letting you down on my expectations···

During this period, I tried several times to recruit people, but couldn't find a suitable UE engine programmer. There are too few UE engine programs in the market, and programs that meet the requirements of our project are also unwilling to come to our independent game workshop. After sharing the income obtained from "Real Estate tycoon" with the investors, I didn't have the money to recruit outstanding programmers on my own;

There are various reasons why 'Real Estate tycoon' has taken this step. Firstly, I did not prepare enough money in the early stages of project approval, and pinned my hope on the capital. The capital chain of the capital was broken, and the art resources provided to me were too late. During the research and development process, I also made significant adjustments to the project's research and development direction due to the lack of art resources and personal thoughts, cutting off many interesting gameplay, In the end, it was sold in a pure simulation management gameplay, but it failed to meet the expectations of me and many players; But my pricing is indeed 50% lower than other urban construction games on the market, with over 100 skylines, over 100 transportation enthusiasts, and over 200 island tycoons. I also know that the games I produce are far from these excellent urban construction games, so I hope everyone understands the pricing issue. The development process of 3D games with decoration and construction is very complex, and there should be few cheaper ones on the market than me;

During this year of lockdown, I also experienced a moment of despair where my spine was broken and I was confined to bed for six months. Now that I have recovered, I spent more than two months recruiting Unity programs and art, preparing to give up on a real estate tycoon to develop a new game with Unity engine. This time, I have planned a project development cycle of two years, and have also prepared enough money for the team to develop it for two years. This money is the money my parents hope for me to buy a house and get married, But I believe that I have the ability to create an excellent game myself, so I also strive to make the game without being influenced by the management. I hereby promise to the old players of "Real Estate tycoon" that my new game will give them KEY (after the new game is released, come to QQ group to ask for KEY). While apologizing to the old players, I am also very grateful for everyone's support in the past. Thank you very much!

The current plan for the new game type is a type of riding and chopping game, which can be understood as a big map operation cultivation of horse riding and chopping+a small map RTS battle of Hero Company/Red Alert/Warcraft;

Interested players can also join a new group: 125220489. Let's talk about a new game together. Thank you for your support, and please give me some time. I will create a game that satisfies myself and everyone, and give myself and players a complete explanation;

To all the players who support me

-Pi Zai

